      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "Speak now in the ears of the people, and let every man ask of his neighbor, and every woman of her neighbor, jewels of silver, and jewels of gold.”",
      "ko": "백성에게 말하여 남녀로 각기 이웃들에게 은, 금패물을 구하게 하라 하시더니",
      "source_text_hash": "6ef040b7e2d2043bc6d2c1e472573b17d053a008501cb7e8ed58bbdfd3f679ea",
      "translation_text_hash": "e5c80e0cafebd24f1cde6dab74dc3297196eeb738a5f5eaf77a17350206cfbf2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "백성에게 말하여 남녀로 각기 이웃들에게 은, 금패물을 구하게 하라 하시더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
